        <mxCell id="classDescriptions" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#f8f9fa;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#333333;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;Class descriptions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Patient:&lt;/b&gt; Registered client who books appointments, pays fees, and places medication orders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Clinic:&lt;/b&gt; Healthcare facility that manages schedules, confirms bookings, and processes medication orders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Appointment:&lt;/b&gt; Scheduled visit linking patient, doctor, and clinic resources with date, time, and status.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Doctor:&lt;/b&gt; Licensed clinician employed by the clinic who conducts consultations and issues prescriptions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Prescription:&lt;/b&gt; Clinical authorization listing diagnosis and medication instructions after consultation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Payment:&lt;/b&gt; Financial record for services rendered, tracking amount charged and payment outcome.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;MedicationOrder:&lt;/b&gt; Tracks dispensing of prescribed medicine from placement through fulfilment and patient notification." vertex="1">
